      "text": "WHEREAS, after a thorough study as to the manner in which the\nModel Cities Program should be structured in order to best accomplish\nits purposes, it is the intention of the Mayor to establish in the\nOffice of the Mayor a Model Cities Administration comparable to the other\nadministrations of the City carrying out major City programs, and",
